  "content": "<div><a href=\"https://www.picmonkey.com/colors/yellow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.picmonkey.com/colors/yellow</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个网站 picmonkey.com 月访问量122万，60%来自于美国，30%来自于自然搜索。 比较神奇的是，还有7%的付费搜索。 他到底有什么服务能赚钱呢，值得去投广告。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>每个月花10万美元广告费，也就是说肯定能够赚回10万美元回来。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>广告吸引的是寻找在线编辑图片的用户。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>上来就弹窗收费，虽然有跳过，但也比较小。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/z7oun8xvg2_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>在线编辑图片的需求，居然也能赚钱。</div>",
